// master.json v6.0.0-synthesis (Claude 3.7 Sonnet)
//

// What this is: A quality framework that makes any structured content better.

// Think of it as a spell-checker, but instead of fixing typos, it fixes how

// information is organized. It finds repetition, untangles complexity, and

// makes documents clearer. The framework can even improve itself, which proves

// it works. We built it by combining the best ideas from software engineering,

// writing guides, and user experience design. Multiple philosophies unified

// into one system that runs automatically and actually delivers results.

